# Demo recording: the GIF is committed (README needs it); the MP4 is the
# preview copy vhs also emits, and two copies of the same take is one too many.
docs/demo/*.mp4

# Screenshot tape: the frames it captures are committed, the animation is not.
# vhs requires an Output line, so the recording exists as a by-product and
# nothing reads it.
docs/demo/screens/screens.gif
